codex
The diagnosis found a container PID/procfs mismatch: processes see small namespace PIDs, but `/proc/<pid>/exe` is absent, while `/proc/self/exe` works. Lean 4.22 resolves its executable through `/proc/<pid>/exe`, causing both errors. I’m applying a narrowly scoped preload shim in `/tmp/audit-work` that redirects only `/proc/<number>/exe` reads to `/proc/self/exe`, then I’ll rerun the exact trusted preflight with that environment.
apply patch
